<span style="color:Azure"><strong>--Details--</strong></span><br>
<<if $Adopted == 0>>
    $Player.Name lives with his biological family.
<<elseif $Adopted == 1>>
    $Player.Name was adopted as a baby.
<</if>><br>

<<if $Bedwetter == 0>>
